    "name": "FlashArray REST Active Directory Public Keys API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Active Directory configuration authenticates users for NFS using Kerberos or SMB using Kerberos\nor New Technology LAN Manager (NTLM). Active Directory is also used to authorize users by\nmapping identities across the NFS and SMB protocols by using LDAP queries.\n",
